IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `jprra-reports`

-- Judicial Proceedings (Regulation of Reports) Act 1960, ss 2 to 5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_judicial-proceedings-regulation-of-reports-act-1960.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a divorce report naming the parties and the decision` MEANS Publication WITH
    `about judicial proceedings` IS TRUE
    `kind of proceedings` IS `divorce`
    `contains indecent matter injurious to public morals` IS FALSE
    `contains a particular outside the permitted list` IS FALSE
    `is a court document printed for the proceedings or sent to those concerned` IS FALSE
    `is published under the directions of the court` IS FALSE
    `is a bona fide law report series or professional technical publication` IS FALSE

